# 2026-11-05 UDS 冒烟测试

平台：STM32F407 + i.MX6ULL，真实 CAN 500 kbps。

## 命令与输出

```text
./uds_cli can0 session 03
TX: 10 03
RX: 50 03
{"cmd":"session","status":"ok"}

./uds_cli can0 tester-present
TX: 3E 00
RX: 7E 00
{"cmd":"tester-present","status":"ok"}

./uds_cli can0 read-did F180
TX: 22 F1 80
RX: 62 F1 80 10
{"cmd":"read-did","did":"F180","status":"ok","len":1}

./uds_cli can0 read-did F190
TX: 22 F1 90
RX: 62 F1 90 4C 46 56 32 41 32 31 4B 37 41 33 30 30 30 30 30 31
{"cmd":"read-did","did":"F190","status":"ok","len":17}
VIN: LFV2A21K7A3000001

./uds_cli can0 read-did 1234
TX: 22 12 34
RX: 7F 22 31
{"cmd":"read-did","status":"nrc","nrc":"0x31"}
```

